request.description:
Same semantics as /chat, but streamed as Server-Sent Events for a typing-effect UI. Postman shows the raw SSE body rather than rendering it live — use a browser EventSource or curl -N to see it stream token by token.

Frame format, one JSON object per `data:` line:
```
data: {"token": "Die"}

data: {"token": " Ausbildung"}

...
data: {"done": true}
```
A declined question streams the fallback message as a single token frame, then `done`. On failure mid-stream you get `data: {"error": "generation failed"}` instead of `done`.
